kind: scene
id: puzzle.bell
title: The chapel bell
on: examine
target: fixture.bellRope
priority: 10
spentBy: "run.bellRung"
---

## Bell

@narrator{code="0010"}: The rope is stiff and smells of pigeons. Far above, the bell waits.
<match subject="run.hour">
  <when is="h03">
    @narrator{code="0020"}: You pull. The bell speaks once, and all through the building the beds stop creaking.
    @maud{code="0010" vo}: Three o'clock. The round. Everybody down.
    @narrator{code="0030"}: And from the morgue, faint, the long sigh of a gurney that has finally been parked.
    ::set{run.bellRung = true}
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @narrator{code="0040"}: You pull. The bell answers, loud and wrong, and the sound goes looking for someone.
    @nell{code="0010" mono when="entry.diary.read"}: Three. The diary said three. Not now.
    ::lure{room="chapel"}
  </otherwise>
</match>
